[00:35.30]Jehovah, God of love,
[00:38.44]You have promised us your peace.
[00:42.72]So we ask you for your spirit;
[00:47.70]May its fruitage yet increase.
[00:52.18]Our faith in your dear Son,
[00:56.30]Who is loyal, ever true,
[01:00.92]Gives us access to your friendship;
[01:05.26]We are now at peace with you.
[01:14.58]Your spirit aids our sight
[01:17.84]As your Word gives needed light.
[01:22.38]We are guided and protected
[01:26.70]In a world as dark as night.
[01:31.78]Until the time has come
[01:35.04]When all wars and terrors cease,
[01:40.50]May your spirit bless our efforts
[01:44.80]To maintain our godly peace.
[02:04.76]You’ve gathered those you love,
[02:09.04]Both in heaven and on earth,
[02:13.50]We’re united by your spirit
[02:17.70]To proclaim the Kingdom’s birth.
[02:24.40]Your righteous Kingdom rule
[02:27.91]Soon will bring an end to war.
[02:33.18]Then the meek ones will delight to
[02:37.20]Live in peace forevermore.
